{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12149","headline":"京兆尹厅前甘棠树降甘露 · 钱起","name":"京兆尹厅前甘棠树降甘露","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"内史用尧意，理京宣惠慈。\n气和祥则降，孰谓天难知。\n济旱露爲兆，有如埙应篪。\n岂无夭桃树，洒此甘棠枝。\n玉色与人净，珠光临笔垂。\n协风与之俱，物性皆熙熙。\n何必凤池上，方看作霖时。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12149.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12149","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}